<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Membership | SNPN</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        /* Shared page header style */
        .page-header {
            background-color: var(--primary-blue);
            color: var(--text-white);
            padding: 60px 10%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: inset 0 -10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .page-header h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .page-header p {
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .membership-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 60px auto;
            padding: 0 5%;
        }

        .section-title {
            color: var(--primary-blue);
            font-size: 28px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent-blue);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        /* --- Benefits Grid --- */
        .benefits-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .benefit-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-white);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .benefit-icon {
            font-size: 36px;
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .benefit-card h3 {
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .benefit-card p {
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* --- Tiers/Pricing Cards --- */
        .tiers-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
            align-items: stretch;
        }

        .tier-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-white);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .tier-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        /* Highlight feature for Life Membership */
        .tier-card.featured {
            border: 2px solid var(--accent-blue);
        }

        .badge {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            right: 15px;
            background-color: var(--accent-blue);
            color: var(--text-white);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .tier-name {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: var(--primary-blue);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .tier-price {
            font-size: 36px;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .tier-price span {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .tier-features {
            list-style: none;
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .tier-features li {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .tier-features li i {
            color: #2ed573; /* Green checkmark */
        }

        /* --- Instructions / Bank Details Card --- */
        .instructions-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-white);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
        }

        .instructions-card h3 {
            color: var(--primary-blue);
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .instructions-list {
            padding-left: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .instructions-list li {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-gray);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .bank-details {
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-blue);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <div class="page-header">
        <h1>SNPN Membership</h1>
        <p>Join a community committed to advancing neuroscience research</p>
    </div>

    <div class="membership-container">
        
        <h2 class="section-title">Why Join Us?</h2>
        <div class="benefits-grid">
            <div class="benefit-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired benefit-icon"></i>
                <h3>Scientific Network</h3>
                <p>Connect with top neuroendocrinologists, researchers, and peers across the nation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-gavel benefit-icon"></i>
                <h3>Conference Discounts</h3>
                <p>Enjoy reduced registration fees for all annual meetings, workshops, and symposiums.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-card">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap benefit-icon"></i>
                <h3>Grants & Awards</h3>
                <p>Gain exclusive eligibility to apply for research fellowships and travel grants.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="section-title">Membership Categories</h2>
        <div class="tiers-grid">
            
            <div class="tier-card">
                <h3 class="tier-name">Student Member</h3>
                <div class="tier-price">₹[Amt] <span>/ Annual</span></div>
                <ul class="tier-features">
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Access to digital newsletter</li>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Discounted conference entry</li>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Poster presentation eligibility</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="tier-card featured">
                <span class="badge">Recommended</span>
                <h3 class="tier-name">Life Member</h3>
                <div class="tier-price">₹[Amt] <span>/ One-time</span></div>
                <ul class="tier-features">
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Lifetime membership privileges</li>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Voting rights in general body</li>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Eligible for executive council</li>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Priority entry & maximum discounts</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="tier-card">
                <h3 class="tier-name">Ordinary Member</h3>
                <div class="tier-price">₹[Amt] <span>/ Annual</span></div>
                <ul class="tier-features">
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Standard membership benefits</li>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> General body access</li>
                    <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Regular processing discounts</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

        </div>

        <h2 class="section-title">How to Apply</h2>
        <div class="instructions-card">
            <h3>Registration Process</h3>
            <ol class="instructions-list">
                <li>Choose your desired membership tier from the options listed above.</li>
                <li>Transfer the corresponding fee using online banking (NEFT/RTGS/IMPS) to the official account listed below.</li>
                <li>Take a screenshot or save the receipt/transaction ID of your successful payment.</li>
                <li>Email your details along with your CV and payment proof to <strong>membership@snpn.org</strong> (or submit via the application form if active).</li>
            </ol>

            <div class="bank-details">
                <strong>Account Name:</strong> Society of Neuropeptides and Neuroendocrinology<br>
                <strong>Bank Name:</strong> [Bank Name]<br>
                <strong>Account Number:</strong> XXXXXXXXXXXX<br>
                <strong>IFSC Code:</strong> XXXXXXXXXXX<br>
                <strong>Branch:</strong> [Branch Name, City]
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>